SET S TO SHIP.
WAIT UNTIL HASNODE.
WAIT UNTIL NEXTNODE:ETA<120.
LOCK STEERING TO NEXTNODE.
WAIT UNTIL NEXTNODE:ETA<17.
SET S:PARTS[0]:RESOURCES[0]:ENABLED TO TRUE.
STAGE.
UNLOCK STEERING.
WAIT 60.
STAGE.
WAIT 10.
STAGE.
S:PARTS[1]:GETMODULE("ModuleDeployableAntenna"):DOEVENT("extend antenna").
UNLOCK THROTTLE.